// However, since the model_new.py calls cuda_extension.multihead_attention_forward,
// we need to provide a launcher that computes the attention output.
// The implementation below uses cuBLAS for GEMMs and custom kernels for softmax,
// but we cannot include torch operations. We will use raw CUDA and cuBLAS APIs.
